   "fact": "Program area field: 'Regional air-quality recovery planning'."
  }
 ],
 "public_definitions": [
  "Select the follow-up route that best matches the overall dashboard trend for the 2018-2023 planning case.",
  "Option 1: Route the record to routine air-quality recovery monitoring.",
  "Option 2: Route the record to air-quality recovery expansion follow-up.",
  "Option 3: Route the record to air-quality deterioration response review."
 ],
 "uncertain": [
  "No explicit numeric values are printed at each data point; the 2018 value appears just above the 2,800 tick and the 2020 peak slightly above 2,800, but exact scores are not labeled.",
  "The mapping from 'overall trend' (flat-to-slightly-declining after 2020) to a specific route is interpretive; the chart title says 'Increasing' while the line's later years are flat/declining, creating a mild conflict between title wording and line shape."
 ]
